WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.332 --> 00:00:02.052
Lekin... kya sab languages

2
00:00:02.072 --> 00:00:03.398
ka... ek common ancestor

3
00:00:03.418 --> 00:00:04.408
tha? Ek pehli language

4
00:00:04.773 --> 00:00:05.861
jise sab log bolte

5
00:00:05.881 --> 00:00:07.171
the... aur baad mein

6
00:00:07.191 --> 00:00:08.065
woh alag ho gayi?

7
00:00:08.339 --> 00:00:09.500
Iska pakka jawab kisi

8
00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:11.188
ke paas nahi hai.

9
00:00:11.208 --> 00:00:11.861
Aur ye sirf ek

10
00:00:11.881 --> 00:00:14.401
sawaal hai... jawab nahi.

